Module governance.input.refs.case50.
Profile "eu-ai-act-high-risk".

Define GuardContext has amount as Decimal, tier as Text, band as Text, meta as Map Text to Text.
Define GuardRequest has principal_roles as List of Text, action as Text, context as GuardContext.

Rule g given m as Text, produce Bool:
  Return m equals to "x".

@id("R-1")
@control("EU_AI_ACT:ART14")
Rule decide given req as GuardRequest, produce Verdict:
  Let b be List.concat([Maybe.withDefault(Map.get(req.context.meta, "a"), "")], req.principal_roles).
  Let r1 be g(b).
  Let a be Maybe.withDefault(Map.get(req.context.meta, "a_principal_roles"), "").
  Let r2 be g(a).
  Let r3 be g(b).
  If r1 and r2 and r3:
    Return Verdict.deny("x").
  Return Verdict.allow().
